​Hello Karan Aujla Sir, I hope you are doing well. I am writing this message to you in the comment section because only you can help me with this. I am asking for your help regarding Prem Dhillon, who is a good friend of yours. He has a  named (𝗦𝗼𝗻𝗴 - 𝗝𝘂𝘀𝘁 𝗔 𝗗𝗿𝗲𝗮𝗺), which I had set as my Hello Tune on the Airtel Wynk Music app for the past 3 years. However, in July, that song was permanently removed. I spoke to Airtel Customer Care, sent them an email, and also emailed the Wynk Music app. The response I received from them is that the license for this song has expired, and it can only be restored if the owner of the song wants to. Since this song belongs to Prem Dhillon Ji, only he can bring it back. Karan Aujla Sir, I also tried reaching out to Prem Dhillon Ji via Instagram comments and sent emails to him and his team, but I haven't received any response yet. Airtel has clearly stated that this song will return only if Prem Dhillon Ji wishes to bring it back. One more thing: this song is available on Jio, but I do not want to port my number to Jio. I want this song permanently on Airtel. I am requesting you, Karan Aujla Sir, to please call Prem Dhillon Ji and tell him about this. I am a huge fan of yours, which is why I tried contacting you, as you are active on social media and reply to your fans. Therefore, I have written this message to you. It is an emergency request; please ask Prem Dhillon Ji about this. Here is my ID, and I am sending you my mobile number in a DM. Please send him my number. Sir, I am messaging you with a sincere request to contact him for me so that he gives me a call. I want to explain to him the same message I wrote to you. You can inform him once, and I will also explain it to him directly. Please, sir, it's a request, and whatever conversation happens between me and Prem Dhillon Ji will remain strictly private; I will not share it with anyone. Please help me, sir. 🙏🙁 Also, sir, I am from Punjab, living in Firozpur
